*Workshop conducted by Mr. Ahmed Shaikh Founder of Rigel Infotech*
hands-on workshop on Roblox Game Programming for IT and Data Science students.
The workshop provided students with practical exposure to game development concepts, scripting, and interactive design using the Roblox platform. Participants actively engaged in creating their own game environments, enhancing their coding skills, creativity, and problem-solving abilities.

earning + Creativity + Coding = A Perfect Combo! 🚀
